      "date": "2026-11-06 08:56:49.000000000",
      "message": "Patch Set 2: Verified+1\n\nPassed enforced test review-ldiskfs-dne-arm on RHEL 8.10 / x86_64, Rocky 9.8 / aarch64 uploaded by Onyx Autotest from onyx-154vm25: https://testing.whamcloud.com/test_sessions/140d721d-1c4e-45d1-b99f-f28d2ba9461d ran 5 tests.",
